   "body": "Among the key issues on the agenda are the crisis in Myanmar, tensions in the South China Sea, regional security and economic cooperation. The meetings will also give Asean leaders an opportunity to assess the Philippines’ chairship priorities and discuss the bloc’s response to pressing regional and global challenges. Follow our live updates for the latest developments, key statements and announcements from the summit. /dl WATCH: Police blocked protesters from marching from Liwasang Bonifacio to the Philippine International Convention Center (PICC). Protesters tried to evade the police barricade, but resulted in a violent pushing and shoving between the two sides. | @zacariansINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvFBpX 🌏 FROM COMMODITY TO IDENTITY: What does it take for Asean’s small businesses to turn their products into recognizable brands and reach bigger markets? https://t.co/jslaQ9Zqqh LOOK: The eleven Asean leaders share the Asean handshake the as the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits formally opened this Sunday. They were likewise joined by leaders, representatives of the Asean dialogue partners, and their spouses for a photo at the stage. | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvF3Ap LOOK: Various protest groups gathered in Liwasang Bonifacio in Manila as the 49th Asean Summit commences. The group will march toward the Philippine International Convention Center (PICC), which serves as the main venue of the summit, around 10 a.m. | via @zacariansINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvF3Ap 🤖 THE INFRASTRUCTURE OF INTELLIGENCE: What does Asean need to make artificial intelligence (AI) work for everyone? https://t.co/FwUdnNX7tf LOOK: President Ferdinand \"Bongbong\"Marcos Jr., chair of Asean 2026, presents the updated Asean flag and its accompanying certificate to Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary General of Asean. | 📷: Screengrab from Asean 2026 PH/Facebook via @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvF3Ap WATCH: President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. officially declares the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits open. | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/LpWQ33rARd ‘WE DARE TO DREAM, WE CARE TO SHARE TOGETHER FOR ASEAN’ WATCH: Filipina soprano Lara Maigue sings The Asean Way, the official anthem of the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (Asean) as the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits open this Sunday at the PICC. | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvF3Ap LOOK: Leaders and representatives of the Asean member-states, guests of the chair, and their spouses ride tricycles adorned with ‘Mabuhay Asean’ signages before they enter the plenary hall at the PICC as the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits open this Sunday. | @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/HV7POvF3Ap LOOK: President Prabowo Subianto of Indonesia arrives for the opening ceremony of 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/Da67VATwbm LOOK: Sultan Haji Hassanal Bolkiah and Prince Abdul Mateen Bolkiah of Brunei arrives for the opening ceremony of 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/7PR8BdyuhW LOOK: Lawrence Wong, Prime Minister of Singapore, arrives for the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/4PihGrrjfl LOOK: Dato Seri Anwar Ibrahim, Prime Minister of Brunei, arrives for the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/BY77wDPksM LOOK: Saleumxay Kommasith, Prime Minister of Laos, arrives for the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/SADB7Jrc2T LOOK: Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Deputy Prime Minister of Cambodia, arrives for the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/cFnmUrsik0 LOOK: Director General U Han Win Aung, representative of Myanmar, arrives for the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/B1fVmiwmME LOOK: President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. arrives at the PICC for the opening ceremony of the 49th Asean Summit. | @JEMendozaINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/8ZIx70qgge LOOK: Thailand Prime Minister Anutin Charnvirakul, the Republic of Indonesia President Prabowo Subianto, and Malaysia Prime Minister Dato’ Seri Anwar Ibrahim arrived in the Philippines ahead of the 49th Asean and related summits this Nov. 15 to 17. Also in the country are His Majesty Sultan Haji Hassanal Bolkiah of Brunei Darussalam and United Nations Secretary General António Guterres. | 📷: Asean 2026 PH via @bellepechayINQ LOOK: Singapore Prime Minister Lawrence Wong arrives in the Philippines this Sunday for the 49th Asean and Related Summits. | 📷: Screengrab from ASEAN 2026 PH/Facebook via @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/lf3GwIQe7A LOOK: International Monetary Fund Managing Director Kristalina Georgieva arrives in the country early Sunday for the 49th Asean and Related Summits. | 📷: Screengrab from ASEAN 2026 PH/Facebook via @bellepechayINQ Follow our live updates here: https://t.co/JWrNCFaHLW https://t.co/Nliv7Nw8fX",
