   "title": "zamfara stands still as gov lawal hosts first lady remi tinubu for mega rally",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/promoted/925054-zamfara-stands-still-as-gov-lawal-hosts-first-lady-remi-tinubu-for-mega-rally.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
