   "title": "Korean won weakens against US dollar as oil prices surge",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261113/korean-won-weakens-against-us-dollar-as-oil-prices-surge",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
   "source": "koreatimes.co.kr",
